Package: tigervnc-wws-viewer
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: TigerVNC viewer with VNC File Drop for the WWS
 The TigerVNC viewer of the file-drop branch: files dragged onto the viewer
 window are offered to the VNC session through the side channel the server
 announces (DesktopEndpoint) and uploaded with tus.  Installed as
 tigervnc-wws-viewer next to the viewer of the distribution.
